{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Soccer Simulator throws you into chaotic, messy matches where the rules don\u2019t matter. Just you, the ball, and the streets\u2014slide, smash, and score in the most fun and unpredictable soccer brawls you\u2019ve ever played!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/14a8fa079fff09bed6f8a9ec31c345d9.webp?t=1772547082\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/57ac508299d29e6f3bcf18d6a79e276a.poster.avif?t=1772547082\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/57ac508299d29e6f3bcf18d6a79e276a.webm?t=1772547082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/57ac508299d29e6f3bcf18d6a79e276a.mp4?t=1772547082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Street Soccer Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Soccer Simulator brings the raw energy of street football to your screen. Play fast-paced, no-rules matches in gritty urban environments where anything goes. It\u2019s all about outplaying, outsmarting, and out-chaosing your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/a13d258aaf936c8c281cd679a7348e2a.webp?t=1772547082\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/c5ac10c772feca3640a922e4e29db028.poster.avif?t=1772547082\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/c5ac10c772feca3640a922e4e29db028.webm?t=1772547082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/c5ac10c772feca3640a922e4e29db028.mp4?t=1772547082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into quick matches with two wild teams and one packed street arena. Face off against CPU opponents in unpredictable matches full of slides, deflections, and last-second goals. Pure street fun\u2014no refs, no rules, just soccer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940300?t=1772547082","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940300?t=1772547082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/772cb9688cf4ea42510b9d48687c90d1ea1dd0a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772547082","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/772cb9688cf4ea42510b9d48687c90d1ea1dd0a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772547082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Street Soccer Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940300/extras/52b3839b69d7dfa432ec658c09ddb888.avif?t=1772547082\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Soccer Simulator throws you into chaotic, messy matches